From: TensorFold recipe <noreply@invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] dsv41 lanes: enforce tool_choice required

The CUDA host advertises call_gates. A required or named tool choice opens the answer with the template tool-call token and completes an offered name. Requests without tool_choice are unchanged. A lone drafted fast path still skips a request that must call a tool.

